{"change_summary":"Restored `tank_core`'s `tank_data` dev-dependency so the preset-loading integration tests compile again, retuned the shipped `hard_shrimp`, `moderate`, `soft_acidic`, and `ro_like` source-water presets to carry differentiated carbonate inputs that land in the requested pH/KH bands, rewrote the preset provenance notes to describe the real-world water each profile is emulating, updated the preset/scenario assertions for the new low-buffer RO-like behavior, and clarified that `SourceWaterProfile::zero()` is a stricter test helper rather than the shipped RO preset.","outstanding_risks":["The retuned DIC/alkalinity values are calibrated against the current carbonate solver; if solver constants or fallback behavior change later, these presets may need another pass.","Validation was focused on the affected carbonate/data/scenario paths rather than the full workspace test suite."],"steps":[{"description":"Restored the `tank_data` dev-dependency in `crates/tank_core/Cargo.toml` and picked up the corresponding `Cargo.lock` entry so `tank_core` integration tests can load shipped source-water presets through the real data path.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Retuned the four shipped source-water TOMLs with differentiated DIC and alkalinity targets, including making `ro_like` a lightly remineralized low-buffer profile instead of an all-zero regression fixture, and updated their plain-language provenance notes.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Adjusted carbonate regression expectations in `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` and `crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs` so the test suite now enforces the requested pH ordering and target bands, including acidic low-buffer RO behavior.","order":3,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Clarified `SourceWaterProfile::zero()` as an extreme test helper rather than the shipped RO preset and ran focused validation across `tank_core`, `tank_data`, and `tank_scenarios`.","order":4,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --test source_water_carbonate` passed: 8/8 tests, including preset loading through `tank_data`, DIC/alkalinity water-change math, differentiated pH behavior, RO buffering reduction, and the 500-hour `nano_cycle` source-water story.","`cargo test -p tank_data` passed: 32/32 unit tests plus doc tests, including `shipped_source_water_presets_have_distinct_carbonate_ph` with the new hard/moderate/soft/ro target bands.","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios` passed: 17/17 tests plus doc tests, including `shipped_source_water_profiles_materialize_distinct_initial_ph` and the scenario materialization/startup-override coverage that exercises the shipped source-water catalog.","Manual solver spot-check of the tuned preset inputs yields distinct preview pH values in the intended order: `ro_like` 6.244, `soft_acidic` 6.760, `moderate` 7.134, `hard_shrimp` 7.644."]}